#: extensions/scylla-base/src/shell/whats-new.ts:80
msgid "Your projects as cards with their pipelines, with search, filters and sort. Put them in colored groups, pin your favorites, drag them into your own order and pick a display: cards, list or tiles. Your groups also show in the sidebar."
